  "intro": [
    "Start a fresh Release 23 game. Enter each numbered command at its own prompt; repeated WAIT commands are intentional. Seed 1 selects the Sao Vera when Johnny shows the coin.",
    "Take the note and key, secure your bankbook and shipwreck book, withdraw $500, then show the cash to Johnny and accept his deal. Pay the $401 contribution, buy the flashlight and shark repellent, and recover the envelope from McGinty's office after he leaves.",
    "Hide the envelope under the Mary Margaret bunk before delivery. Set latitude 40 and longitude 45. Before sleeping, eat stew and drink water. Expose the Weasel and connect the deep-sea suit to the running compressor before the dive."
  ],
